  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5506.06 Standard for Granting Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5506.06 Standard for Granting Motion for Rehearing. Notwithstanding any rule to the contrary in Saf-C 203, a motion for rehearing in a case subject to appeal under RSA 541 shall be granted if it demonstrates that the commissioner’s decision is unlawful, unjust, or unreasonable.\n\nSource. #10121, eff 4-25-12); ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22 (formerly Saf-C 5506.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5500.html"
